  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n& \\text { Let } E=\\cot \\left(\\operatorname{cosec}^{-1} \\frac{5}{3}+\\tan ^{-1} \\frac{2}{3}\\right) \\\\\n& \\Rightarrow E=\\cot \\left(\\tan ^{-1}\\left(\\frac{3}{4}\\right)+\\tan ^{-1}\\left(\\frac{2}{3}\\right)\\right) \\\\\n& \\Rightarrow E=\\cot \\left(\\tan ^{-1}\\left(\\frac{\\frac{3}{4}+\\frac{2}{3}}{1-\\frac{3}{4} \\cdot \\frac{2}{3}}\\right)\\right) \\\\\n& \\Rightarrow E=\\cot \\left(\\tan ^{-1} \\frac{17}{6}\\right)=\\frac{6}{17} .\n\\end{aligned}\n$$",
    "image": null
  },
